#: bec1d9f5b7774322818294ca0c4f41b8
msgid ""
"The `Seagull IR <https://www.seagulluav.com/product/seagull-ir/>`__ is a low"
" cost infrared camera trigger device that supports a wide range of camera "
"brands and models (`see compatible camera list here "
"<https://www.seagulluav.com/product/seagull-ir/>`__).  More detailed "
"instructions on how to setup IR are provided in the `Seagull IR Manual "
"<https://www.seagulluav.com/manuals/Seagull_IR-Manual.pdf>`__ as well as the"
" `Seagull IR Support <https://www.seagulluav.com/seagull-ir-support/>`__ "
"page."
msgstr ""
"`Seagull IR <https://www.seagulluav.com/product/seagull-ir/>`__ "
"是一款低成本红外相机触发设备，支持多种相机品牌和型号（`兼容相机列表见此 "
"<https://www.seagulluav.com/product/seagull-ir/>`__）。关于如何设置 IR 的详细说明，请参阅 "
"`Seagull IR Manual <https://www.seagulluav.com/manuals/Seagull_IR-"
"Manual.pdf>`__ 及 `Seagull IR Support <https://www.seagulluav.com/seagull-ir-"
"support/>`__ 页面。"

